                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The control record\nnow ties the\nreading to a\nmeasured result.\nDot",
                                  "speaks a little\nlouder when she\nrecommends testing\nthe signal reply",
                                  "separately from\nthe alarm. Rivet\ndoes not finish\nthe sentence for",
                                  "her. That may be\nthe warmest thing\nanyone has done\nall day."
                                ],
